[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9780.07, "timestamp": "02:43:00", "text": "是的。是的。因为我还有大约11个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9782.71, "timestamp": "02:43:02", "text": "几个月，对吧？所以，没问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9786.15, "timestamp": "02:43:06", "text": "所以，我很高兴。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9789.11, "timestamp": "02:43:09", "text": "是的。告诉我一声就好。好的。你好。全部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9791.75, "timestamp": "02:43:11", "text": "正确的。我刚刚问：你还在直播吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9795.99, "timestamp": "02:43:15", "text": "或者你哦，我会继续直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9798.23, "timestamp": "02:43:18", "text": "好的。好的。好了，好好享受剩下的时光吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9802.07, "timestamp": "02:43:22", "text": "我可能喜欢去吃东西，也喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9804.71, "timestamp": "02:43:24", "text": "是的。登船后稍后再来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9808.87, "timestamp": "02:43:28", "text": "是的。好的。你好。各位再见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9811.59, "timestamp": "02:43:31", "text": "各位再见。谢谢你，艾丽西亚。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9813.349, "timestamp": "02:43:33", "text": "临走前你还有什么想说的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9815.83, "timestamp": "02:43:35", "text": "例如任何公告或更新"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9817.67, "timestamp": "02:43:37", "text": "任何事物？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9821.429, "timestamp": "02:43:41", "text": "不，你只要继续收看你的频道就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9828.23, "timestamp": "02:43:48", "text": "是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9830.63, "timestamp": "02:43:50", "text": "谢谢你告诉我日期。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9839.99, "timestamp": "02:43:59", "text": "好了，各位，那位就是伊莉莎。"}]